GVDG players-ratings pipeline
=============================

The PDGA live-rating algorithm in pipeline/rating.py is a faithful port of
"calculate_rating" from:

    cclark20/pdga-whats-my-rating
    https://github.com/cclark20/pdga-whats-my-rating
    Licensed under the MIT License.

The pdga.com scraping approach in pipeline/pdga.py is adapted from the same
project's classes/player.py and from cole-clark/disc-golf-data's src/players.py,
both MIT-licensed.

The ported test cases in tests/test_rating.py are adapted from that project's
tests/test_rating_calc.py and tests/test_rating_accuracy.py, and the regression
fixture CSVs under tests/fixtures/ are copied from its tests/fixtures/.

The "count_scores" score-distribution tally in pipeline/stats.py is a faithful
port of "count_scores" from:

    cclark20/disc-golf-data
    https://github.com/cclark20/disc-golf-data
    Licensed under the MIT License.

    (src/udisc_live.py)

